# STEP files are redistributed fixtures that must be byte-identical to their
# source, regardless of the cloning machine's core.autocrlf setting. Without
# this, git's line-ending normalization silently rewrites CRLF -> LF on commit,
# breaking the exact-byte-count claim in tests/fixtures/NIST-PROVENANCE.md.
#
# Both extensions and both cases: gitattributes patterns are case-sensitive,
# and tolcad.gen.export writes `.step` while the NIST suite ships `.stp`.
*.stp binary
*.STP binary
*.step binary
*.STEP binary
